<title>PAKISTAN: Latest results in Pakistani election.</title>
<headline>Latest results in Pakistani election.</headline>
<dateline>ISLAMABAD 1996-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistanis voted in national and provincial elections on Monday. Here are the latest results in polling for the 217-seat National Assembly (lower house):</p>
<p>    PARTY							  SEATS</p>
<p>    Pakistan Muslim League (PML)				 3</p>
<p>    Pakistan People's Party (PPP)				0</p>
<p>    Mohajir National Movement (MQM)			    0</p>
<p>    Pakistan People's Party-Shaheed Bhutto (PPP-SB)	0</p>
<p>    Awami National Party (ANP)				   1</p>
<p>    Tehrik-i-Insaaf (Justice Movement)			 0</p>
<p>    Smaller parties/independents				 0</p>
</text>
